Nke mbụ, gịnị ka onye ahịa na-eme na Sistemụ Ndebanye Ihe nkiri?

00:08:52.230 --> 00:08:54.230
Ka anyị jụọ ndị ọkachamara n'ihe gbasara ngalaba

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.880
Gịnị ka ndị ahịa na-eme?

00:08:57.880 --> 00:08:59.970
Ndị ahịa na-achọ ihe nkiri,

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.450
Lee nkọwa ihe nkiri ahụ,

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:02.910
Họrọ oge nlele,

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.450
Họrọ oche gị,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:05.920
Debe tiketi ihe nkiri,

00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:07.610
Lelee nkọwa ndoputa,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:10.180
Mee ihe dịka ịkagbu ndoputa

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:15.750
Ịhọrọ oge ngosi na ịhọrọ oche ọ̀ bụ akụkụ nke usoro ndoputa tiketi ihe nkiri?

00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:18.880
Na idobe tiketi ihe nkiri, ịkagbu ndoputa

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:22.210
Ka o sina dị, ọ̀ bụ na ị naghị azụta tiketi ma nwetaghachi ego gị?

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.620
ị nwetara ya

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.030
Nke ahụ dị mma

00:09:25.480 --> 00:09:27.880
Maka na ọ bụ ngalaba a maara nke ọma ugbu a

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:31.240
Họrọ oge nlele ma họrọ oche gị

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.200
Nke a ọ bụ akụkụ nke usoro ndoputa tiketi ihe nkiri?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:34.530
Enwere m ike ịjụ

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.220
Ma ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ ngalaba a na-amaghị ama,

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:40.160
Ịtụle nkebi ojiji ọ bụla n'ụzọ zuru ezu

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:43.330
Ị ga-emeghachi usoro nchacha ahụ ọtụtụ ugboro.

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:45.350
Dabere na ọnọdụ ọrụ ahụ

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.080
I nwere ike imeghachi usoro a ọtụtụ oge,

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:50.580
Ka ị na-ewepụta oge gị ma na-enyocha nke ọma,

00:09:50.580 --> 00:09:54.190
Belata nnwale na mmejọ n'oge nhazi na mmejuputa.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.530
Dabere na mkparịta ụka ruo ugbu a

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.970
Anyị ahaziela ọnọdụ ojiji ndị ahịa anyị n'ime ụdị anọ:

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.470
Onye nchịkwa na-esote bụ onye nchịkwa

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:08.850
Onye nchịkwa ahụ nwere ike ịhụ na e nwere ihe njikwa ise:

00:10:09.440 --> 00:10:13.620
N'onwe m, ana m akpachara anya maka iji okwu ahụ bụ "Jikwaa" eme ihe n'ime mmepe.

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.980
Njikwa sara mbara nke ukwuu

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.030
Ihe ị na-eme edoghị anya

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:20.950
Ọ bụkwa otu ihe ahụ ebe a

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:23.760
Kedu kpọmkwem otu esi ejikwa ya?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:24.810
Amaghị m

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.620
Site n'ịgwa ndị ọkachamara ngalaba okwu

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:31.220
Agbasawanyela ihe njikwa ọ bụla gaa n'ọnọdụ ojiji kpọmkwem.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:33.660
Ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ ezigbo ọrụ

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:35.890
O nwere ike ịbụ na e nwere ọtụtụ ihe eji eme ihe karịa nke a.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.000
Lee ka m si mee ka ọ dị mfe maka nkọwa.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.700
Ihe dị mkpa ịmara ebe a bụ na mgbe ị na-emepụta oge ịgba ọsọ,

00:10:43.020 --> 00:10:45.900
I nwere ike ịhụ na e mekwara tiketi ahụ

00:10:46.960 --> 00:10:49.200
Ma mgbe ị na-azụ ma ọ bụ na-akwụghachi tiketi

00:10:49.490 --> 00:10:53.910
I nwekwara ike ịhụ na anyị na-eji ọrụ mpụga nke a na-akpọ ọnụ ụzọ ịkwụ ụgwọ.

00:10:55.890 --> 00:10:58.670
Ejikọtara m ihe eji eme ihe nke ndị ahịa na ndị njikwa.

00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:01.730
Na-ele anya na ojiji niile dịka nke a

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:02.900
Ihe dị ka ihe tọgbọrọ chakoo

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.840
Enwere nhọrọ ịgbakwunye ihe nkiri

00:11:05.840 --> 00:11:08.720
Ahụghị m ihe ọ bụla dị ka Ụlọ Ihe Nchọgharị

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.130
O yiri ka e nwere ọtụtụ ihe eji eme ihe ndị a na-ewepụ.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:15.980
Maka na site n'echiche nke ọkachamara ngalaba, e nwere ọtụtụ ihe a ga-akọwa.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.950
Ihe eji eme ihe a, nke yiri ka ọ doro anya,

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:19.810
I nwere ike ịhapụ nkọwa ahụ

00:11:20.770 --> 00:11:23.460
Gịnịzi banyere onye mmepụta ihe?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:28.290
Ọ ka mma ịhapụ akụkọ dị mfe dịka ịchọ ebe a na-eme ihe nkiri.

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:30.700
Nke a ọ́ gaghị enyere aka karịa maka njikwa akwụkwọ?

00:11:31.720 --> 00:11:32.870
Ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ imewe azụ

00:11:32.870 --> 00:11:35.920
Ihe eji eme ihe dị mfe dịka ịchọ ụlọ ihe nkiri

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.760
Echere m na ọ dị mma ịhapụ ya

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:41.570
Ihe m na-ekwu bụ na oge agafebeghị ịzaghachi n'oge mmejuputa.

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:44.310
Mana ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ ezigbo ọrụ

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:48.450
Maka ndị na-eme atụmatụ ihuenyo, ihe ndị a na-eji eme ihe bụ ezigbo ebe mmalite.

00:11:49.250 --> 00:11:52.300
Onye nhazi ahụ lere anya n'ihe gbasara ịchọ ebe a na-eme ihe nkiri.

00:11:52.300 --> 00:11:55.300
Kedu ka m ga-esi mee ka o kwe omume ịchọ ụlọ ihe nkiri?

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:56.600
Ị ga-enwe ike iche echiche

00:11:58.000 --> 00:12:00.880
Mgbe ị jikọtara eserese ndị ahụ n'otu, ọ na-adị ka ihe siri ike.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.150
Ọ bụrụ na ọ bụ ezigbo ọrụ, ọ ga-adị mgbagwoju anya karịa.

00:12:05.720 --> 00:12:08.240
N'okwu a, ọ dịghị mkpa ịmanye njikọta.

00:12:08.810 --> 00:12:13.910
Ejikọtara m ha ebe a iji kpughee na e nwere ikpe ndị na-efu efu.

00:12:16.020 --> 00:12:18.490
Edejupụtara m ikpe niile furu efu

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:21.880
Enwere m ihe atụ ebe e wepụrụ njikọ na onye na-eme ihe nkiri ahụ.

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:25.720
Nke a metụtara ma ndị ahịa ma ndị njikwa.

00:12:26.400 --> 00:12:29.480
Maka mfe itinye ya n'ọrụ, edere m ya n'asụsụ Bekee.

00:12:31.370 --> 00:12:34.160
Ọ dị mma ugbu a n'ihi na ọ bụ obere ọrụ

00:12:34.160 --> 00:12:36.160
Ọ bụrụ na ọrụ ahụ buru ibu ma dị mgbagwoju anya

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:38.980
Ebee ka ọkachamara ngalaba kwesịrị ịmalite ịkọwa?

00:12:38.980 --> 00:12:40.380
O nwere ike isi ike

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:43.300
Gịnị ka onye nchịkwa na-eme?

00:12:43.300 --> 00:12:44.700
Ọ bụ nnukwu ọrụ

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:46.620
Dịka a tụrụ anya ya n'aka onye njikwa

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.750
N'okwu a, anyị nwere ike kewaa ndị na-eme ihe nkiri?

00:12:49.750 --> 00:12:52.340
Ọ dịkwa mma ịtụleghachi

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:54.790
Na mbụ, a kpọrọ m onye nchịkwa

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.400
O nwere ike ịbụ na e kewara ya site n'ọrụ dị iche iche

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.820
Na iji Sistemụ Ndebanye Ihe Nkiri

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:02.870
Enwere ike ịnwe ọrụ mpụga

00:13:03.660 --> 00:13:05.340
Ọ bụrụ na anyị kewaa ndị na-eme ihe nkiri n'otu ụzọ ahụ,

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.420
Ndị ọkachamara n'ihe gbasara ngalaba ga-enwe ike inye ozi gbasara usoro.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.000
N'ezie, nke a bụ naanị otu ihe atụ nke inyocha ngalaba dị mgbagwoju anya.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:17.320
Enwere ike ịnwe ụzọ ndị ọzọ dị mma

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:21.740
Ọ dị mkpa ịzaghachi n'ụzọ dị mfe dabere na ọnọdụ ahụ.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:25.060
Nke a bụ mmechi

00:13:25.950 --> 00:13:29.170
Oge a, anyị ga-eji eserese ihe atụ ojiji

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.840
Setịpụ ihe mgbaru ọsọ maka ọrụ ahụ

00:13:31.230 --> 00:13:33.700
Agabigala m usoro nyocha mbụ.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:38.010
N'onwe gị, n'oge usoro mmepe dum

00:13:38.010 --> 00:13:40.060
Echere m na nyocha bụ nke kacha sie ike

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:44.250
Maka na anyị ga-ahazi echiche ndị kacha dị omimi na ndị na-edoghị anya.

00:13:45.020 --> 00:13:47.650
Oge ọzọ anyị ga-eleba anya na okwu ndị bụ isi gbasara ojiji

00:13:47.650 --> 00:13:49.470
Ka anyị nyochaa ya nke ọma.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.100
Daalụ maka ọrụ siri ike unu ruo ugbu a.

